---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.jsx';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="GEL BLASTER FAQ | Advanced Action Sports"
  description="Frequently asked questions about gel blaster at Advanced Action Sports in Webster, Massachusetts. Find answers about pricing, gear, age requirements, and more."
  canonical="https://www.advancedactionsports.com/gel-blaster-faq"
  ogTitle="GEL BLASTER FAQ | Advanced Action Sports"
  ogDescription="Frequently asked questions about gel blaster at Advanced Action Sports in Webster, Massachusetts."
>
<PageHero title="GEL BLASTER FAQ" btnUrl="https://advancedactionsports.square.site/s/search?q=gel%20blaster" btnText="Book Now" />

<section class="page-actions">
  <div class="container">
    <a href="https://waivermaster.com/sign.html?q=MQH6WTTY" class="btn btn-secondary">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="margin-right: 6px;"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/></svg>Sign Waiver
    </a>
    
    <a href="/gel-blaster/" class="btn btn-secondary">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="margin-right: 6px;"><path d="M19 12H5M12 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>Back to Gel Blaster
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="page-content faq-page">
  <div class="container">

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>Does Gel-Blaster hurt?</h3>
      <p>Not really. Most players say it feels like a nerf dart, or a flick.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>What should I wear?</h3>
      <p>You can wear any type of clothes, but closed toe shoes are required.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>How old do you need to be to play?</h3>
      <p>The minimum age to play Gel-Blaster is 8.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>How much does it cost?</h3>
      <p>Gel-Blaster is affordable, and is only $25 for a session pass with a rental package included.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>If I have a Groupon, how do I book?</h3>
      <p>All you have to do is email or call, and we can help book you in.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>Do we need a reservation to play?</h3>
      <p>Yes, reservations are always required for Gel-Blaster.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>Can I bring in my own food?</h3>
      <p>Outside food and beverage are not permitted onsite.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>Do I need to do anything before arriving?</h3>
      <p>Yes, you'll want to have your waiver completed, in addition to reading the rules and regulations.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>Can I have alcohol onsite?</h3>
      <p>No. Alcohol, smokeless tobacco, and Marijuana products are not permitted onsite.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>Can I simply drop my kids off?</h3>
      <p>Yes, as long as you accompany them to the check-in counter, you may leave them with us.</p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
</BaseLayout>
